*> T9905 (34-3 sections 7 and 8, 9.3 and 9.4; 34-6 section 3.3): the blocks that mobs carry, drawn from the baked model of a block state through the layer's operations in the frame of
*> the part the layer starts from. A snow golem's pumpkin (the head's frame, gone once the pumpkin flags bit 16 is clear, hidden when invisible and not glowing), the poppy an iron golem offers
*> (the right arm's frame while the offer-flower tick is above 0), the block an enderman carries (the model root) and the block on a copper golem's antenna (the saddle slot's block item).
*> The expected centres are worked out independently from the documents' tables: the standard render sequence at yaw 0 maps a model point (x, y, z) to (x, -y, -z) plus (0, 1.501, 0).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-ENTITY-CARRY.
