 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. NEAR-FLAG.
*> USING a, b, tolerance (FLOAT-LONG), flag out (BINARY-LONG): 1 when a and b differ by less than the tolerance.
 DATA DIVISION.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-A                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-B                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-TOL                  FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-FLAG                 BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-A L-B L-TOL L-FLAG.
     MOVE 0 TO L-FLAG
     IF FUNCTION ABS(L-A - L-B) < L-TOL
         MOVE 1 TO L-FLAG
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM NEAR-FLAG.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. BB-GI.
*> USING CLIENT-STATE, eye (3 FLOAT-LONG), box out (min x y z, max x y z): the bounding box of the ground item mesh in world coordinates.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-V                   FLOAT-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-EYE-TABLE.
    05 L-EYE               FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 3 TIMES.
 01 L-BOX.
    05 L-BV                FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 6 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-EYE-TABLE L-BOX.
     MOVE 1000000 TO L-BV(1) L-BV(2) L-BV(3)
     MOVE -1000000 TO L-BV(4) L-BV(5) L-BV(6)
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > RL-GI-COUNT
         COMPUTE WS-V = RL-GI-X(WS-I) + L-EYE(1)
         MOVE FUNCTION MIN(L-BV(1), WS-V) TO L-BV(1)
         MOVE FUNCTION MAX(L-BV(4), WS-V) TO L-BV(4)
         COMPUTE WS-V = RL-GI-Y(WS-I) + L-EYE(2)
         MOVE FUNCTION MIN(L-BV(2), WS-V) TO L-BV(2)
         MOVE FUNCTION MAX(L-BV(5), WS-V) TO L-BV(5)
         COMPUTE WS-V = RL-GI-Z(WS-I) + L-EYE(3)
         MOVE FUNCTION MIN(L-BV(3), WS-V) TO L-BV(3)
         MOVE FUNCTION MAX(L-BV(6), WS-V) TO L-BV(6)
     END-PERFORM
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM BB-GI.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. MM-SPAWN.
*> USING CLIENT-STATE, entity id, type (registry id), x y z (FLOAT-LONG), yaw (FLOAT-SHORT, also the head yaw): Add Entity.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 WS-READY               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 1024.
 01 WS-ADD                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-ZERO                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-UUID                PIC X(16) VALUE LOW-VALUES.
 01 WS-V0                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-V1                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-V2                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-A0                  FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-ID                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-TYPE                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-X                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-Y                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-Z                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-YAW                  FLOAT-SHORT.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-ID L-TYPE L-X L-Y L-Z L-YAW.
     IF WS-READY = 0
         CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
         MOVE 1 TO WS-READY
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER L-ID
     CALL "PB-PUT-UUID" USING PB-BUFFER WS-UUID
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER L-TYPE
     CALL "PB-PUT-DOUBLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-X
     CALL "PB-PUT-DOUBLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-Y
     CALL "PB-PUT-DOUBLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-Z
     CALL "PB-PUT-LPVEC3" USING PB-BUFFER WS-V0 WS-V1 WS-V2
     CALL "PB-PUT-ANGLE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-A0
     CALL "PB-PUT-ANGLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-YAW
     CALL "PB-PUT-ANGLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-YAW
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-ZERO
     MOVE 0 TO PB-POS
     CALL "ENTITY-PACKET" USING CLIENT-STATE PB-BUFFER WS-ADD
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM MM-SPAWN.

